/Title (This activity aims to give a perspective as we also aim to develop an app for a movie ticketing system. This app will allow users to book their movie tickets online and advanced, pick out their preferred seats and schedule, select what other concessionaires that they want and also receive the confirmation of their booking along with their digital ticket. This ensures an easy way and a user-friendly experience for the cinema owners and the customers which improves the efficiency of the movie owners and the satisfaction of the customers)
